@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Component context and neighbors
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

component "Web / job entry" as E
component "Example Presentation owner" as P
component "Identity authority provider" as I
component "Persistence adapter" as D
component "Applications consumer" as A
E --> P : explicit publication command
A --> P : separate permitted projection contract
P --> I : current scoped authority
P --> D : owned guarded persistence
note bottom of P
 No direct consumer writes to Presentation internals.
 Submission capture belongs to Applications;
 no implicit send or publication on source edit.
end note

@enduml
